From: Mr Douvis <douvis@hellenic-culture-ministry.example> (Ministry of Culture, Organising Committee)
To: RAM Media Limited and Parallel Media Group PLC <info@ram-media.example>
Date: 2006-11-01
Subject: Letter no 83 - termination and cancellation

Our letter dated 31st October, faxed early on 1st November, summarised the "mutual agreement of the meeting held on 27th October...".

The Ministry stops immediately all actions towards the event and declares the Agreement terminated and the event cancelled.

Douvis
Organising Committee

--
RECONSTRUCTED FROM THE PUBLISHED JUDGMENT. Not an original document.
Source: RAM Media v Ministry of Culture of the Hellenic Republic [2008] EWHC 1835 (QB), paras 166, 241.
Wording is the judge's summary; signatory not stated. The same day, by letter no 82, the Ministry called the EUR 1,200,000 bank guarantee, which the National Bank paid out of RAM's deposit; a press release said "a gala without the players is not a gala".
